In an <a href="https://www.goodmorningamerica.com/culture/story/tim-cook-talks-apples-50th-anniversary-future-ai-131137939">interview with <em>Good Morning America</em>'s Michael Strahan</a> this week, Apple's CEO Tim Cook responded to rumors about his potential retirement.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2023/05/Tim-Cook-MacBook-16x9.jpeg" alt="" width="1600" height="900" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-894618" /><br/>
Cook said the idea that he wants to step back at Apple is merely "a rumor."<br/>
<br/>
Cook did not explicitly confirm or deny that he will be stepping down as CEO any time soon, but he said "I can't imagine life without Apple."<br/>
<br/>
